-> SEO and web platform optimization

SEO (Search Engine Optimization)
SEO makes your website easy for search engines (like Google) to understand and rank higher

What SEO focuses on:
-> Content & Keywords (Use relevant words users search for)
-> Proper HTML structure (Use semantic tags)
-> Meta tags (<meta name="description" content="Best online store for shoes" />)
-> Clean URLs (Good: /products/shoes | Bad: /page?id=123)

Web Platform Optimization
-> Performance optimization (Minimize JS, CSS, use lazy loading)
-> Image optimization (Compress images, use modern formats (WebP))

SEO → “Can users find your site?”
Optimization → “Is your site fast and smooth?”
👉 Both together = better ranking + better user experience
